				"⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				738,
				125
			],
			"Message": "feat(Output): Inject Webview debugging diagnostics and update CSP\n\nIntroduce three new transform plugins to the Output build pipeline to diagnose extension webview loading failures under WKWebView/Tauri:\n\n- `InjectWebviewDebugLogging`: Injects a `DEBUG_WV` helper and lifecycle logging (INDEX_BOOT, SW_REGISTER, SIGNAL_START/OK/FAIL, CONTENT_EVENT, INNER_FRAME_FAKE/LOADED/WRITE) into the webview preloader.\n- `InjectWebviewRuntimeDiagnostics`: Injects global error handlers, console interception, and React/DOM mutation observers into the runtime to capture unhandled rejections and render failures.\n- `InjectWebviewRuntimeDiagnosticsInner`: Injects diagnostic hooks into the inner iframe creation routine (`toContentHtml`) to monitor module loading and DOM insertion within the extension's isolated context.\n\nSimultaneously, update `RewriteWebviewShellCSP` to include `'unsafe-eval'`, `'wasm-unsafe-eval'`, and explicit `vscode-webview-resource:`/`vscode-file:` permissions in the Content Security Policy to accommodate dynamic extension execution requirements.\n\nThese changes enable detailed traceability of webview bootstrapping and execution phases, facilitating diagnosis of silent hangs and extension load failures.",
			"SHA": "7747bbddd0bbdb2f8cd153d7b7bf90475f70df85"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2026-05-14T03:52:53Z",
			"File": [
